values ('d6e7f8a9-0b1c-4d74-9f34-4a5b6c7d8e14', 'web-interactive-design', 'Web / Interactive Design', 'Web / Interactive Design treats the web as a designed medium shaped by standards, screens, users, interaction, content, and changing device contexts. Students ground decisions in research and evidence, design findable structures and readable responsive screens, and learn enough HTML and CSS to prototype responsibly across devices, input modes, and interaction patterns. They practice wireframing, accessibility, motion, design systems, and UX writing, then evaluate and iterate with usability testing and analytics, examine AI and emerging interfaces, and synthesize the work in a polished responsive interactive product and portfolio case study.');

